error[E0517]: a static field cannot have accessors
 --> $DIR/static-field.nra:4:9
  |
3 |     export static let calls: int = 0;
  |                       ----- 'calls' is declared 'static'
4 |         | get: calls;
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ accessor clause on a static field
  |
  = help: accessors serve instance fields; expose a static field through a static function instead

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0517`.
